\[a(w^{\varepsilon},w^{\varepsilon})\leqslant\varepsilon^{N+1}(\left\|\,a \left\|\,\left\|\,c\left\|/\beta\right\|\,\dot{\lambda}_{N}\right\|_{M}\right\| w^{\varepsilon}\right\|_{X}.\]

